All together the architecture document is useless and of extremely poor quality even if it contents are right, its setup id absolutely useless and makes the project incomprehensible as a whole, this can never be used as an architectural document given the bottom quality it has. an architecture document is to make intent and elements crystal clear not introduce mumbo jumbo vocabulary that is not defined.
